# Frontend

Stack: **React 19**, **Vite 6**, **TypeScript strict**, **React Router 7**, **MUI 6** + **Tailwind v4** (`@tailwindcss/vite`), **TanStack Query**, **Lucide** icons.

Legacy path `frontend/` follows same rules as `apps/web/`.

## Entry and providers

`main.tsx` → `App` only. Provider order (outside → in):

```tsx
<ThemeProvider>
  <CssBaseline />
  <QueryClientProvider>
    <AuthProvider>
      <BrowserRouter>...</BrowserRouter>
    </AuthProvider>
  </QueryClientProvider>
</ThemeProvider>
```

Domain providers (`CartProvider`, etc.) live inside **layout routes**, not global `App`, unless truly app-wide.

## Folder structure

```
src/
├── app/              # App.tsx, routes.tsx, providers.tsx, query-client.ts
├── features/
│   ├── auth/
│   ├── shop/
│   └── pos/
├── components/       # shared UI only
├── lib/              # api-client, supabase (auth only), muiTheme, format
└── assets/           # brand-static only — not product catalog images
```

Product images come from API (`imageUrl` / file proxy), not 40+ PNG imports in TS.

## Routing

- Nested layouts with `Outlet` (`ShopLayout` for public shop).
- Protected routes: guard component + `?next=` redirect to login.
- `React.lazy` + `Suspense` for heavy routes (`/pos`, admin).
- Global `ErrorBoundary` on shop shell; route-specific boundary on high-risk pages (POS).
- `Route path="*"` → `NotFoundPage`.

## Auth (client)

- `lib/supabase.ts`: anon client singleton; `isSupabaseConfigured` guard.
- **Role and `canAccessPos` from `GET /api/me` only** — not `supabase.from('profiles')`.
- `ready` flag before guards; `onAuthStateChange` + cleanup on unmount.
- Pass `session.access_token` explicitly to API helpers — never read token from `localStorage` manually.

## API client

- One `lib/api-client.ts`: `apiUrl()`, Bearer header, unified error type, `backendHint()`.
- Domain modules: `features/*/api/*.queries.ts` wrapping TanStack Query.
- On 401: `refreshSession()` once, retry once (POS-critical paths).

```ts
function apiUrl(path: string): string {
  const base = (import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL ?? import.meta.env.VITE_BACKEND_URL ?? "").replace(/\/$/, "");
  const p = path.startsWith("/") ? path : `/${path}`;
  return base ? `${base}${p}` : p;
}
```

Dev: empty base → Vite proxy `/api` → local API. Prod: `VITE_API_URL` required at build.

## TanStack Query defaults

| Query | staleTime | notes |
|-------|-----------|-------|
| Catalog | 60_000 | public, cacheable |
| Sales / staff | 0 | `refetchOnWindowFocus` for POS |
| `/api/me` | invalidate on signIn/signOut |

Mutations: `onSuccess` → invalidate related queries.

## Styling

- Tokens in `index.css` (`:root` + `@theme`); MUI theme mirrors same hex in `lib/muiTheme.ts`.
- Layout/spacing: Tailwind. Complex widgets: MUI. No third CSS-in-JS runtime.
- Fonts via `index.html` Google Fonts link — not `@import` in CSS.

## Forms

- MUI `TextField` + HTML validation for simple forms.
- Zod schemas from `@repo/shared` for non-trivial validation — parse before submit.
- No Formik/react-hook-form until 5+ complex forms.

## Performance

- Lazy routes for POS/admin.
- Hero video: `preload="metadata"`, poster, `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback.
- `manualChunks` for `vendor-react`, `vendor-mui` in `vite.config.ts`.
- No static catalog bundled as dozens of image imports.

## PWA / icons

`public/`: `favicon.svg`, `apple-touch-icon.png` (180×180), `icon-192.png`, `icon-512.png`, `site.webmanifest`. See `web-app-icons.mdc` if present.

## Tooling

- `vite.config.ts`: `strictPort: true`, proxy `/api`, `appType: "spa"`.
- Build: `tsc -b && vite build`.
- ESLint flat config; Husky at monorepo root runs eslint on web.
- Declare all `VITE_*` in `vite-env.d.ts`.

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ `REACT_APP_*`, `setupProxy.js` (CRA legacy)
- ❌ `fetch` to Supabase PostgREST for business data
- ❌ `process.env` — use `import.meta.env.VITE_*`
- ❌ Export utilities from `*.tsx` component files (breaks HMR) — use `lib/` or feature `hooks/`
- ❌ Provider inside router if guards need auth context
